#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:2
msgid "How to use cross-references with Sphinx"
msgstr "如何在 Sphinx 中使用交叉引用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:4
msgid ""
"When writing documentation you often need to link to other pages of your "
"documentation, other sections of the current page, or sections from other "
"pages."
msgstr "编写文档时，你经常需要链接到文档的其他页面、当前页面的其他章节，或其他页面的章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:9
msgid ""
"An easy way is just to use the raw URL that Sphinx generates for each "
"page/section. This works, but it has some disadvantages:"
msgstr "一种简单做法是直接使用 Sphinx 为每个页面/章节生成的原始 URL。这行得通，但有一些缺点："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:12
msgid "Links can change, so they are hard to maintain."
msgstr "链接可能变化，难以维护。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:13
msgid ""
"Links can be verbose and hard to read, so it is unclear what page/section "
"they are linking to."
msgstr "链接可能冗长且难以阅读，看不出指向哪个页面/章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:14
msgid ""
"There is no easy way to link to specific sections like paragraphs, figures, "
"or code blocks."
msgstr "没有便捷方式链接到段落、图表或代码块等特定章节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:15
msgid "URL links only work for the html version of your documentation."
msgstr "URL 链接仅对文档的 HTML 版本有效。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:17
msgid ""
"Instead, Sphinx offers a powerful way to linking to the different elements "
"of the document, called *cross-references*. Some advantages of using them:"
msgstr "相比之下，Sphinx 提供了链接到文档各元素的有力方式，称为*交叉引用* 。使用它们的好处包括："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:21
msgid "Use a human-readable name of your choice, instead of a URL."
msgstr "使用你选择的人类可读名称，而非 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:22
msgid "Portable between formats: html, PDF, ePub."
msgstr "跨格式可移植：html、PDF、ePub。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:23
msgid "Sphinx will warn you of invalid references."
msgstr "Sphinx 会就无效引用发出警告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:24
msgid "You can cross reference more than just pages and section headers."
msgstr "交叉引用的对象不止页面和章节标题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:26
msgid ""
"This page describes some best-practices for cross-referencing with Sphinx "
"with two markup options: reStructuredText and MyST (Markdown)."
msgstr "本页介绍使用 Sphinx 交叉引用的若干最佳实践，涉及两种标记选项：reStructuredText 和 MyST（Markdown）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you are not familiar with reStructuredText, check "
":doc:`sphinx:usage/restructuredtext/basics` for a quick introduction."
msgstr "若不熟悉 reStructuredText，查阅 :doc:`sphinx:usage/restructuredtext/basics` 快速入门。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you want to learn more about the MyST Markdown dialect, check out :doc"
":`myst-parser:syntax/reference`."
msgstr "若想深入了解 MyST Markdown 方言，请查阅 :doc:`myst-parser:syntax/reference` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:37
msgid "Table of contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:40
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:45
msgid "Explicit targets"
msgstr "显式目标"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:47
msgid ""
"Cross referencing in Sphinx uses two components, **references** and "
"**targets**."
msgstr "Sphinx 中的交叉引用由两个要素组成：**引用** 和** 目标** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:49
msgid ""
"**references** are pointers in your documentation to other parts of your "
"documentation."
msgstr "**引用** 是指向文档其他部分的指针。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:50
msgid "**targets** are where the references can point to."
msgstr "**目标** 是引用可以指向的位置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:52
msgid ""
"You can manually create a *target* in any location of your documentation, "
"allowing you to *reference* it from other pages. These are called **explicit"
" targets**."
msgstr "你可以在文档任意位置手动创建*目标* ，从而从其他页面* 引用* 它。这称为**显式目标** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:55
msgid "For example, one way of creating an explicit target for a section is:"
msgstr "例如，为章节创建显式目标的一种方式是："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:59
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:87
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:114
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:136
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:178
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:229
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:284
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:341
msgid "reStructuredText"
msgstr "reStructuredText"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:70
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:96
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:143
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:186
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:237
