#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:348
msgid "MyST (Markdown)"
msgstr "MyST（Markdown）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:79
msgid "Then the reference will be rendered as `My target`_."
msgstr "这样引用将渲染为 `My target`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:81
msgid ""
"You can also add explicit targets before paragraphs (or any other part of a "
"page)."
msgstr "你也可以在段落（或页面其他任何部分）之前添加显式目标。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:83
msgid "Another example, add a target to a paragraph:"
msgstr "另一个例子，为段落添加目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:105
msgid ""
"Then the reference will be rendered as: `some disadvantages <target to "
"paragraph>`_."
msgstr "这样引用将渲染为：`some disadvantages <target to paragraph>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:107
msgid ""
"You can also create _`in-line targets` within an element on your page, "
"allowing you to, for example, reference text *within* a paragraph."
msgstr "你也可以在页面元素内部创建 _`行内目标`，例如引用段落*内部* 的文本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:110
msgid "For example, an in-line target inside a paragraph:"
msgstr "例如，段落内的行内目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:121
msgid ""
"Then you can reference it using ```in-line targets`_``, that will be "
"rendered as: `in-line targets`_."
msgstr "随后可用 ```in-line targets`_`` 引用它，将渲染为：`in-line targets`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:125
msgid "Implicit targets"
msgstr "隐式目标"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:127
msgid ""
"You may also reference some objects by name without explicitly giving them "
"one by using *implicit targets*."
msgstr "你也可以使用*隐式目标* 按名称引用某些对象，无需显式为其命名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:131
msgid ""
"When you create a section, a footnote, or a citation, Sphinx will create a "
"target with the title as the name:"
msgstr "创建章节、脚注或引文时，Sphinx 会以标题为名称创建目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:152
msgid ""
"This requires setting ``myst_heading_anchors = 2`` in your ``conf.py``, see "
":ref:`myst-parser:syntax/header-anchors`."
msgstr ""
"这需要在 ``conf.py`` 中设置 ``myst_heading_anchors = 2`` ，参见 :ref:`myst-"
"parser:syntax/header-anchors` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:155
msgid "The reference will be rendered as: `Explicit targets`_."
msgstr "该引用将渲染为：`Explicit targets`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:158
msgid "Cross-referencing using roles"
msgstr "使用角色进行交叉引用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:160
msgid ""
"All targets seen so far can be referenced only from the same page. Sphinx "
"provides some roles that allow you to reference any explicit target from any"
" page."
msgstr "目前所见的所有目标只能从同一页面引用。Sphinx 提供了一些角色，允许你从任意页面引用任意显式目标。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:165
msgid ""
"Since Sphinx will make all explicit targets available globally, all targets "
"must be unique."
msgstr "由于 Sphinx 会让所有显式目标全局可用，所有目标必须唯一。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:168
msgid ""
"You can see the complete list of cross-referencing roles at :ref:`sphinx"
":xref-syntax`. Next, you will explore the most common ones."
msgstr "完整交叉引用角色列表见 :ref:`sphinx:xref-syntax` 。接下来我们看看最常用的几个。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:172
msgid "The ref role"
msgstr "ref 角色"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:174
msgid "The ``ref`` role can be used to reference any explicit targets. For example:"
msgstr "``ref`` 角色可用于引用任意显式目标。例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:193
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:245
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:355
msgid "That will be rendered as:"
msgstr "将渲染为："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:195
msgid ":ref:`my target`."
msgstr ":ref:`my target` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:196
msgid ":ref:`Target to paragraph <target to paragraph>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Target to paragraph <target to paragraph>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:197
msgid ":ref:`Target inside a paragraph <in-line targets>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Target inside a paragraph <in-line targets>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:199
msgid "The ``ref`` role also allow us to reference code blocks:"
msgstr "``ref`` 角色还允许我们引用代码块："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:215
msgid ""
"We can reference it using ``:ref:`code <target to code>```, that will be "
"rendered as: :ref:`code <target to code>`."
msgstr ""
"我们可以用 ``:ref:`code <target to code>``` 引用它，将渲染为：:ref:`code <target to code>`"
" 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:219
msgid "The doc role"
msgstr "doc 角色"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:221
msgid ""
"The ``doc`` role allows us to link to a page instead of just a section. The "
"target name can be relative to the page where the role exists, or relative "
"to your documentation's root folder (in both cases, you should omit the "
"extension)."
msgstr "``doc`` 角色允许我们链接到页面而非仅章节。目标名称可以相对于该角色所在页面，也可以相对于文档根目录（两种情况下都应省略扩展名）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:225
msgid "For example, to link to a page in the same directory as this one you can use:"
msgstr "例如，要链接到与本页同目录的页面，可用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:247
msgid ":doc:`intersphinx`"
msgstr ":doc:`intersphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:248
msgid ":doc:`/guides/intersphinx`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/intersphinx`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:249
msgid ":doc:`Custom title </guides/intersphinx>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Custom title </guides/intersphinx>`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:253
msgid ""
"Using paths relative to your documentation root is recommended, so you avoid"
" changing the target name if the page is moved."
msgstr "推荐使用相对于文档根目录的路径，这样页面移动时无需更改目标名称。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:257
msgid "The numref role"
msgstr "numref 角色"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:259
msgid ""
"The ``numref`` role is used to reference **numbered** elements of your "
"documentation. For example, tables and images."
msgstr "``numref`` 角色用于引用文档中的**带编号** 元素，例如表格和图片。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:262
msgid "To activate numbered references, add this to your ``conf.py`` file:"
msgstr "要启用编号引用，在 ``conf.py`` 文件中添加："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:269
msgid ""
"Next, ensure that an object you would like to reference has an explicit "
"target."
msgstr "接下来，确保你想引用的对象具有显式目标。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:271
msgid "For example, you can create a target for the next image:"
msgstr "例如，你可以为下一张图片创建目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:275
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "Logo"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:280
msgid "Link me!"
msgstr "Link me!"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:309
msgid ""
"Finally, reference it using ``:numref:`target to image```, that will be "
"rendered as ``Fig. N``. Sphinx will enumerate the image automatically."
msgstr "最后用 ``:numref:`target to image``` 引用它，将渲染为 ``Fig. N`` 。Sphinx 会自动为图片编号。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:314
msgid "Automatically label sections"
msgstr "自动为章节添加标签"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:316
msgid ""
"Manually adding an explicit target to each section and making sure is unique"
" is a big task! Fortunately, Sphinx includes an extension to help us with "
"that problem, :doc:`autosectionlabel "
"<sphinx:usage/extensions/autosectionlabel>`."
msgstr ""
"手动为每个章节添加显式目标并确保唯一是项大工程！幸运的是，Sphinx 包含一个扩展来帮助解决这个问题：:doc:`autosectionlabel "
"<sphinx:usage/extensions/autosectionlabel>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:320
msgid ""
"To activate the ``autosectionlabel`` extension, add this to your ``conf.py``"
" file:"
msgstr "要启用 ``autosectionlabel`` 扩展，在 ``conf.py`` 文件中添加："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:334
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sphinx will create explicit targets for all your sections, the name of "
"target has the form ``{path/to/page}:{title-of-section}``."
msgstr "Sphinx 会为你的所有章节创建显式目标，目标名称形式为 ``{path/to/page}:{title-of-section}`` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:337
msgid "For example, you can reference the previous section using:"
msgstr "例如，可用以下方式引用上一节："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:357
msgid ":ref:`guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx:explicit targets`."
msgstr ":ref:`guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx:explicit targets` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:358
msgid ":ref:`Custom title <guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx:explicit targets>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Custom title <guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx:explicit targets>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:361
msgid "Invalid targets"
msgstr "无效目标"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:363
msgid ""
"If you reference an invalid or undefined target Sphinx will warn us. You can"
" use the :option:`-W <sphinx:sphinx-build.-W>` option when building your "
"docs to fail the build if there are any invalid references. On Read the Docs"
" you can use the :ref:`config-file/v2:sphinx.fail_on_warning` option."
msgstr ""
"若引用了无效或未定义的目标，Sphinx 会发出警告。构建文档时可使用 :option:`-W <sphinx:sphinx-build.-W>` "
"选项，在存在无效引用时使构建失败。在 Read the Docs 上可使用 :ref:`config-"
"file/v2:sphinx.fail_on_warning` 选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:369
msgid "Finding the reference name"
msgstr "查找引用名称"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:371
msgid ""
"When you build your documentation, Sphinx will generate an inventory of all "
"explicit and implicit links called ``objects.inv``. You can list all of "
"these targets to explore what is available for you to reference."
msgstr "构建文档时，Sphinx 会生成包含所有显式和隐式链接的清单文件 ``objects.inv`` 。你可以列出这些目标，了解有哪些可供引用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:375
msgid "List all targets for built documentation with:"
msgstr "用以下命令列出已构建文档的所有目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:381
msgid ""
"Where ``<link>`` is either a URL or a local path that points to your "
"inventory file (usually in ``_build/html/objects.inv``). For example, to see"
" all targets from the Read the Docs documentation:"
msgstr ""
"其中 ``<link>`` 可以是 URL，也可以是指向清单文件的本地路径（通常在 ``_build/html/objects.inv`` "
"）。例如，要查看 Read the Docs 文档的所有目标："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:390
msgid "Cross-referencing targets in other documentation sites"
msgstr "交叉引用其他文档站点中的目标"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/cross-referencing-with-sphinx.rst:392
msgid ""
"You can reference to docs outside your project too! See "
":doc:`/guides/intersphinx`."
msgstr "你也可以引用项目之外的文档！参见 :doc:`/guides/intersphinx` 。"

